{"path": "/projects", "params": {"search": "compliance audit", "per_page": 8, "order_by": "star_count", "sort": "desc", "simple": "true", "visibility": "public"}, "data": [{"id": 70402481, "description": "Crystal Forge builds secure, verifiable software ecosystems by embedding compliance, integrity, and trust into the entire lifecycle\u2014from development to deployment. We empower organizations to evolve DevSecOps into a system of continuous assurance, where every component is provable, auditable, aligned with policy, and mapped directly to required security frameworks.", "name": "Crystal Forge", "name_with_namespace": "Crystal Forge / Crystal Forge", "path": "crystal-forge", "path_with_namespace": "crystal-forge/crystal-forge", "created_at": "2025-06-02T01:26:15.104Z", "default_branch": "dev", "tag_list": [], "topics": [], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:crystal-forge/crystal-forge.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/crystal-forge/crystal-forge.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/crystal-forge/crystal-forge", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/crystal-forge/crystal-forge/-/blob/dev/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/project/avatar/70402481/cf-bg.png?v=1794070922", "star_count": 12, "last_activity_at": "2026-11-07T16:45:20.379Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id": 110099902, "name": "Crystal Forge", "path": "crystal-forge", "kind": "group", "full_path": "crystal-forge", "parent_id": null, "avatar_url": "/uploads/-/system/group/avatar/110099902/cf-192.png?v=1761755649", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/groups/crystal-forge"}}, {"id": 78293163, "description": "A fully automated 13-stage DevSecOps CI/CD pipeline that integrates security,\r\ncompliance, and cloud-native deployment using GitLab CI and Amazon EKS.\r\n\r\nThe pipeline demonstrates real-world DevSecOps practices including:\r\n\r\n\u2022 SAST, dependency, container, IaC, and Kubernetes manifest scanning  \r\n\u2022 SBOM generation (CycloneDX)  \r\n\u2022 Automated POA&M creation mapped to NIST controls  \r\n\u2022 Evidence packaging for compliance audits  \r\n\u2022 Secure image push to Amazon ECR  \r\n\u2022 Deployment and validation on Amazon EKS  \r\n\u2022 Full run-to-completion behavior (lab mode) with findings documented rather than blocking\r\n\r\nThis project showcases an end-to-end secure software supply chain workflow suitable for:\r\ncloud engineering, DevOps, cybersecurity, and compliance automation demonstrations.\r\n", "name": "aws-gitlab-lab", "name_with_namespace": "Mike Fernandez / aws-gitlab-lab", "path": "aws-gitlab-lab", "path_with_namespace": "mfernandez76/aws-gitlab-lab", "created_at": "2026-02-06T15:05:30.670Z", "default_branch": "main", "tag_list": ["Compliance", "NIST", "SBOM", "automation", "aws", "cicd", "cloud-native", "devsecops", "docker", "eks.kubernetes", "gitlab-ci", "iac", "security-scanning", "terraform"], "topics": ["Compliance", "NIST", "SBOM", "automation", "aws", "cicd", "cloud-native", "devsecops", "docker", "eks.kubernetes", "gitlab-ci", "iac", "security-scanning", "terraform"], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:mfernandez76/aws-gitlab-lab.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/mfernandez76/aws-gitlab-lab.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/mfernandez76/aws-gitlab-lab", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/mfernandez76/aws-gitlab-lab/-/blob/main/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/project/avatar/78293163/gitlab_badge.png?v=1770591568", "star_count": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-02-08T20:56:35.096Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id": 121617460, "name": "Mike Fernandez", "path": "mfernandez76", "kind": "user", "full_path": "mfernandez76", "parent_id": null, "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/601caffc0e900ef759de6d9157264073f9ac426b24533b95df5ca5379d917ae9?s=80&d=identicon", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/mfernandez76"}}, {"id": 74674196, "description": "A portable acceptance test harness for message-processing domains, built with Java 17 and Spring Boot. It models a minimal DDD flow\u2014normalize \u2192 enrich \u2192 persist\u2014using deterministic, synthetic fixtures and zero external dependencies. Designed for air-gapped, IL4/IL5 environments, the harness runs in under 30 seconds and produces reproducible, CI/CD-safe outputs.\r\n\r\nIncludes embedded H2 database, Spring Cloud Stream test binder (no Kafka required), and a full validation rubric via RUNBOOK.md and ACCEPTANCE_CRITERIA.md. Ideal for teams in compliance-heavy environments who need fast, auditable proof of contract adherence without SaaS reliance.\r\n\r\nArtifacts include fixture validators, Mermaid diagrams, CI config, and acceptance screenshots. Extensible via domain events, repository interfaces, and validation specs.", "name": "acceptance-harness", "name_with_namespace": "Nkosi Felix / acceptance-harness", "path": "acceptance-harness", "path_with_namespace": "ZorillaTrace/acceptance-harness", "created_at": "2025-09-24T01:01:17.758Z", "default_branch": "feat/acceptance-harness-seed", "tag_list": [], "topics": [], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:ZorillaTrace/acceptance-harness.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/ZorillaTrace/acceptance-harness.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/ZorillaTrace/acceptance-harness", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/ZorillaTrace/acceptance-harness/-/blob/feat/acceptance-harness-seed/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": null, "star_count": 1, "last_activity_at": "2026-08-12T00:02:12.882Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id": 115640604, "name": "Nkosi Felix", "path": "ZorillaTrace", "kind": "user", "full_path": "ZorillaTrace", "parent_id": null, "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7fa8ac78882ee31b520b8a64c64edc85c7cf288f511a5d14396b35d93eea80a0?s=80&d=identicon", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/ZorillaTrace"}}, {"id": 70526045, "description": "CISO Assistant is a one-stop-shop for GRC, covering Risk, AppSec, Compliance/Audit Management, Privacy and supporting +90 frameworks worldwide with auto-mapping: NIST CSF, ISO 27001, SOC2, CIS, PCI DSS, NIS2, CMMC, PSPF, GDPR, HIPAA, and more. This is a mirror and the main repo is on Github.", "name": "ciso-assistant-community", "name_with_namespace": "Abderrahmane Smimite / ciso-assistant-community", "path": "ciso-assistant-community", "path_with_namespace": "smimite/ciso-assistant-community", "created_at": "2025-06-05T10:51:31.207Z", "default_branch": "main", "tag_list": ["AppSec", "Compliance", "cybersecurity", "gdpr", "governance", "grc", "risk management"], "topics": ["AppSec", "Compliance", "cybersecurity", "gdpr", "governance", "grc", "risk management"], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:smimite/ciso-assistant-community.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/smimite/ciso-assistant-community.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/smimite/ciso-assistant-community", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/smimite/ciso-assistant-community/-/blob/main/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/project/avatar/70526045/logo-ciso-assistant.png?v=1749209345", "star_count": 1, "last_activity_at": "2025-06-06T11:27:24.704Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id": 122394, "name": "Abderrahmane Smimite", "path": "smimite", "kind": "user", "full_path": "smimite", "parent_id": null, "avatar_url": "/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/106472/baryonyx-deadpool-21393.png?v=1789007948", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/smimite"}}, {"id": 87111058, "description": "OBLIQ.in is an audit and compliance workflow platform for small and mid-sized CA firms. It helps firms centralize client documents, assign and track audit tasks, manage reviews and corrections, monitor pending work, and maintain a clear audit trail of every important action.", "name": "OBLIQ-Website", "name_with_namespace": "OBLIQ-in / OBLIQ-Website", "path": "OBLIQ-Website", "path_with_namespace": "Obliq-in/OBLIQ-Website", "created_at": "2026-10-01T08:26:34.801Z", "default_branch": "main", "tag_list": [], "topics": [], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:Obliq-in/OBLIQ-Website.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/Obliq-in/OBLIQ-Website.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Obliq-in/OBLIQ-Website", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/Obliq-in/OBLIQ-Website/-/blob/main/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": null, "star_count": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-10-01T08:26:34.630Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id": 139857125, "name": "OBLIQ-in", "path": "Obliq-in", "kind": "user", "full_path": "Obliq-in", "parent_id": null, "avatar_url": "/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/41393545/avatar.png?v=1790842979", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/Obliq-in"}}, {"id": 86198617, "description": "Headless-browser crawler and compliance auditor for deceptive UX (dark pattern) detection", "name": "dark-pattern-crawler", "name_with_namespace": "Edgar Ortega / dark-pattern-crawler", "path": "dark-pattern-crawler", "path_with_namespace": "EdgarOrtegaRamirez/dark-pattern-crawler", "created_at": "2026-09-07T22:45:35.417Z", "default_branch": "main", "tag_list": [], "topics": [], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:EdgarOrtegaRamirez/dark-pattern-crawler.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/EdgarOrtegaRamirez/dark-pattern-crawler.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/EdgarOrtegaRamirez/dark-pattern-crawler", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/EdgarOrtegaRamirez/dark-pattern-crawler/-/blob/main/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": null, "star_count": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-09-11T13:52:12.810Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id": 128855, "name": "Edgar Ortega", "path": "EdgarOrtegaRamirez", "kind": "user", "full_path": "EdgarOrtegaRamirez", "parent_id": null, "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34b47353a2fd49ef2d3f534ca3526575396cbdbcf9c7c0e4accd8410219788ee?s=80&d=identicon", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/EdgarOrtegaRamirez"}}, {"id": 86189404, "description": "Audit AI-crawler traffic in web server access logs: classify, verify identity via FCrDNS, check robots.txt compliance, and generate blocking config.", "name": "ai-crawler-audit", "name_with_namespace": "Edgar Ortega / ai-crawler-audit", "path": "ai-crawler-audit", "path_with_namespace": "EdgarOrtegaRamirez/ai-crawler-audit", "created_at": "2026-09-07T16:33:16.875Z", "default_branch": "main", "tag_list": [], "topics": [], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:EdgarOrtegaRamirez/ai-crawler-audit.git", "http_url_to_repo": "https://gitlab.com/EdgarOrtegaRamirez/ai-crawler-audit.git", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/EdgarOrtegaRamirez/ai-crawler-audit", "readme_url": "https://gitlab.com/EdgarOrtegaRamirez/ai-crawler-audit/-/blob/main/README.md", "forks_count": 0, "avatar_url": null, "star_count": 0, "last_activity_at": "2026-09-11T03:20:19.722Z", "visibility": "public", "namespace": {"id": 128855, "name": "Edgar Ortega", "path": "EdgarOrtegaRamirez", "kind": "user", "full_path": "EdgarOrtegaRamirez", "parent_id": null, "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/34b47353a2fd49ef2d3f534ca3526575396cbdbcf9c7c0e4accd8410219788ee?s=80&d=identicon", "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/EdgarOrtegaRamirez"}}, {"id": 85538532, "description": "Black Kyte 17 is a cybersecurity and compliance management platform that helps organizations manage ISO certifications, risk assessments, audits, and security frameworks. We support standards such as ISO 27001, CMMC, Cyber Essentials, and SOC compliance while simplifying documentation, tracking, and compliance processes through a centralized solution design to improve security readiness.\r\nWebsite - https://blackkyte17.com/\r\n", "name": "Black Kyte 17", "name_with_namespace": "Black Kyte17 / Black Kyte 17", "path": "black-kyte-17", "path_with_namespace": "black-kyte17/black-kyte-17", "created_at": "2026-08-19T06:50:49.925Z", "default_branch": "main", "tag_list": [], "topics": [], "ssh_url_to_repo": "git@gitlab.com:black-kyte17/black-kyte-17.git", "http_url_to_repo": "htt